<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise to keep GTM after any merger.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise to keep GTM after any merger.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lyonnaise des Eaux chairman Jerome Monod said on Thursday he wanted to hold onto all Lyonnaise activities after a possible merger with Suez.</p>
<p>Monod told a news conference he wanted to be able to turn Lyonnaise's GTM Entrepose construction unit into a European leader in its field by 1998.</p>
<p>Monod declined to give further details on merger talks with Suez, saying that details would be discussed in the coming weeks and that no terms had yet been set.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
